GenericHouse_A_Text_Adult0::
    .string "Come in, come in! Careful with the\n"
    .string "rug.\p"
    .string "Since the AURA, even my slippers\n"
    .string "change color. I am not joking.$"

GenericHouse_A_Text_Adult1::
    .string "Our town is quiet. Too quiet.\p"
    .string "TEAM ONYBRIS only wants the stones,\n"
    .string "they say. That worries me more.$"

GenericHouse_A_Text_Adult2::
    .string "My husband says types are just\n"
    .string "labels. I say they are habits.\p"
    .string "And habits can change, dear.$"

GenericHouse_A_Text_Adult3::
    .string "Is it true GRENAT came from the old\n"
    .string "mine? My grandfather swore it.$"

GenericHouse_A_Text_Adult4::
    .string "A trainer! Look after your partner.\n"
    .string "They remember every kindness.$"

GenericHouse_A_Text_Adult5::
    .string "I would offer tea, but the kettle\n"
    .string "is sulking. WATER type now.$"

GenericHouse_A_Text_Kid0::
    .string "I saw a trainer beat a whole gym\n"
    .string "with ONE POKéMON!$"

GenericHouse_A_Text_Kid1::
    .string "Mom says never touch the shiny\n"
    .string "rocks. I touched one. It tickled.$"

GenericHouse_A_Text_Kid2::
    .string "When I grow up I will study the\n"
    .string "AURA, like the teacher!$"

GenericHouse_A_Text_Kid3::
    .string "Shh! My POKéMON is hiding. It is\n"
    .string "bad at hide and seek.$"

GenericHouse_A_Text_Kid4::
    .string "Do you have a POKéDEX? Can I see?\n"
    .string "No? Okay.$"

GenericHouse_A_Text_Kid5::
    .string "I drew a new type. It beats\n"
    .string "everything. Don't tell the teacher.$"

